# Requires branch protection on `main` with "Require review from Code
# Owners" enabled (Repo Settings -> Branches -> main) to actually take
# effect — this file alone doesn't block anything by itself.

# Release/publish automation and npm-adjacent config: changes here
# need @syall's review before merging to main, since they control
# what the publish workflow is allowed to do.
/.github/workflows/publish.yml   @syall
/.github/workflows/              @syall
/.changeset/config.json          @syall
/package.json                    @syall
/packages/*/package.json         @syall
